  <data name="ScopeTitle" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Scope and limits</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ScopeDoesHeading" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>What Fleet does</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ScopeDoes1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Enrolls agents with a one-time token and client certificate, and manages each enrollment's trust status.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ScopeDoes2" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Defines migration profiles that describe dry-run requirements.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ScopeDoes3" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Requests read-only work from agents: assessments and migration dry runs.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ScopeDoes4" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Stores the evidence agents return, with an eligibility decision and a hash that approvals reference.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ScopeDoes5" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Records operator approvals of evidence and prepares plans from them.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ScopeDoes6" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Keeps an append-only audit trail of operator, agent, and server actions.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ScopeDoesNotHeading" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>What Fleet does not do</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ScopeDoesNot1" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Fleet doesn't run anything on endpoints. It doesn't start, schedule, or stop migrations, and prepared plans aren't executed.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ScopeDoesNot2" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Fleet doesn't collect identifying data. Hostname, hardware model, disk labels, installed software, operating system, user files, and credentials aren't reported.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ScopeDoesNot3" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Fleet doesn't manage software, updates, configuration, security posture, storage, networking, monitoring, or automation.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ScopeDoesNot4" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Fleet doesn't group enrollments. Each request targets one enrollment.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ScopeDoesNot5" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Fleet Server records operator actions under a shared identity. The console records the console account separately.</value>
  </data>
  <data name="ScopeMigrationNote" xml:space="preserve">
    <value>Migrations run locally through the Community app or the CLI.</value>
  </data>
